[{"title":"閒居杂兴 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"逖观尘途士，党与纷欢呼。\n世无师旷耳，亦获圭璋誉。\n转盼骨己朽，人与年俱徂。\n廓落乾坤内，万古皆吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21979,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中寄怀张明成学士邓以德太史涂汝高侍御三先生二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"维舟章江上，江门多故知。\n念我成远别，朝夕数追随。\n杂佩各持赠，伐木有馀悲。\n惭余虽驽马，敢复背良规。\n长风催彩鹢，恨恨不能移。\n招手成南北，永夜徒相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21980,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中寄怀张明成学士邓以德太史涂汝高侍御三先生二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"学士富经纶，四海拟伊周。\n太史性寂莫，雅志耽玄修。\n侍御温如玉，澄清志已酬。\n我本淡荡者，干时诚足羞。\n我性非干时，我志在千秋。\n所志如未偶，长揖谢王侯。\n为语冥寥士，异派终同流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21981,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪慈训","author":"邹元标","text":"尔上金陵去，何事泪浪浪。\n阿郎听吾训，朝夕慎莫忘。\n尔心虽慈善，尔性何太刚。\n半生滨九死，天度幸汪洋。\n古人佩韦弦，国手审温凉。\n良玉比君子，何事不易方。\n罔发他人隐，罔恃自己长。\n扬善不扬恶，齿颊有馀芳。\n循循身有德，汪汪度难量。\n和气蒸闺阃，子嗣自繁昌。\n勉哉崇令德，古语戒垂堂。\n阿儿听我训，朝夕慎莫忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21982,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出都门宿大觉庵遇二僧时偕曾职方徐尚宝","author":"邹元标","text":"我志在烟霞，肝肠常皎皎。\n言辞鹓鹭班，振衣寻窈窕。\n偶逢识面僧，高卧白云杪。\n谭宗振空谷，羽翼还二妙。\n我本素心人，久绝尘寰扰。\n不藉金篦力，一晤能百了。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21983,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠但友孟皋","author":"邹元标","text":"父母生我身，圣贤觉我仁。\n毫釐如有差，爱敬皆非真。\n彼美名家子，意气凌苍旻。\n浩瀚破千卷，挥毫若有神。\n明月千古珍，灼烁光四邻。\n用之弹鸟雀，叹息道旁人。\n颜生尊四勿，张也敬书绅。\n美玉藉山石，盘铭在日新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21984,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"有客扬青骢，衔命报君王。\n抚枕不能寐，起坐意徬徨。\n徬徨意何许，美人天一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21985,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"老去空山里，同心觉渐稀。\n江河方滔滔，世故日以非。\n脉脉不能语，泪落沾我衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"四海论交日，结发称弟兄。\n出处虽殊致，相期良匪轻。\n送君从此别，归卧掩柴荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21987,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"会面知何时，望君崇明德。\n明德旨惟微，不大声以色。\n纯一以不已，无为见天则。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21988,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其五","author":"邹元标","text":"会心人已远，世儒苦支离。\n葛藤还自缚，苍苍以管窥。\n不如两忘之，日星自昭垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其六","author":"邹元标","text":"寒灰应六律，万卉自春风。\n堪笑夸毗子，人力夺天工。\n玄珠得象罔，忘言意自融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其七","author":"邹元标","text":"莫谓人身小，巍巍可配天。\n廓落复廓落，匠心谁与传。\n庭前有奇树，莫负此因缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其八","author":"邹元标","text":"百年瞬息耳，至难得者人。\n我心非一掬，我性岂识神。\n二曜昭昭在，各各自天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其九","author":"邹元标","text":"勺水即深泉，我心万古心。\n一唯即一贯，不用苦搜寻。\n试看望影者，长啸振空林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安节吴公之还朝也情不能已再为诗十章 其十","author":"邹元标","text":"少年不省事，忆昔徒奔波。\n金屑还翳目，知音岂在多。\n休心复休心，尔我勿虚过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨如石孝廉计偕 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"相见温如玉，相交情断金。\n君登青云去，何处寄吾琴。\n泰山千仞高，龙门百尺深。\n高深会有极，莫负百年心。\n玄珠藏草泽，谁识象罔寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨如石孝廉计偕 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"大道惟率性，至人无饰说。\n圣门贵皓皓，行谊常高洁。\n世纲久沦亡，邈矣愧前哲。\n回首长安道，朔风苦栗烈。\n慇勤欲有赠，衔杯气已结。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过杨椒山墓碑 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"高碑插穹窿，瞻拜心震惊。\n今日泰华重，当年一羽轻。\n勉哉岩廊士，勿愿有斯名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过杨椒山墓碑 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"宿墓多青草，黄云莽莽垂。\n欲别不忍别，令人有遗思。\n毒死忠良士，奚独一分宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"洞是何年辟，寻幽我乍来。\n拨云餐石髓，朵朵莲花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"下榻万缘空，泠然欲御风。\n真人不可作，谁与论参同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"束发诵遗篇，生迟五十年。\n焚香端不愧，心迹可青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"前辈风流在，后来渐不如。\n江河无计挽，深愧彦方居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其五","author":"邹元标","text":"经宵即出洞，密偈付藤萝。\n时有松风至，为僧发浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其六","author":"邹元标","text":"是谁为洞主，非我亦非伊。\n承前须直领，不用转头思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其七","author":"邹元标","text":"岂是鬼神凿，幻出琼花奇。\n月照黄金屋，雪留白玉枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其八","author":"邹元标","text":"遥指岩头桂，先生亲手栽。\n蒲团趺坐稳，时有暗香来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其九","author":"邹元标","text":"开士叩禅关，朗公已出山。\n题诗岩窦里，未许落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石莲洞 其十","author":"邹元标","text":"直上怀濂阁，愁深虎豹关。\n九重天浩荡，赢得老僧閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬王梦峰","author":"邹元标","text":"掀翻尘见解，推倒旧河山。\n谢绝寰中扰，亲身见孔颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观澜轩次谢虚亭韵 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"消磨豪气尽，踪迹任浮沈。\n有地堪逃暑，无人可会心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观澜轩次谢虚亭韵 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"芙蓉我独宿，君自恩江来。\n为结同心友，禅关日日开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题觉今堂 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"大道元无定，如何说觉今。\n须知觉了后，不减原初心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题觉今堂 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"借问觉者谁，未许落言思。\n向日华堂下，寒温祗自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朋来亭","author":"邹元标","text":"圣贤久寂莫，六籍总荒芜。\n夜夜庭前月，相看自不孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻泉亭","author":"邹元标","text":"沥沥泉声响，因风杂涧篁。\n仲尼观逝水，孺子咏沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大意亭","author":"邹元标","text":"突兀群峰耸，凭栏多大意。\n道人何所见，心境还俱弃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舍身岩","author":"邹元标","text":"万法皆应舍，何论泡影身。\n岂因禅定力，久已渡迷津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郭生善篆图书者","author":"邹元标","text":"平生无所好，所好在图书。\n藉此传心印，千秋意不虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"赋性本颛蒙，崎岖一线通。\n万缘随分了，撒手大从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"初学苦支离，閒心自得师。\n纤毫皆帝力，无语付天倪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"人笑我痴愚，胸藏明月珠。\n万方都照彻，随处得真如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"圣学失其真，由人认识神。\n识神生死本，仇怨结交亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其五","author":"邹元标","text":"生涯惟白业，心事只青山。\n花落云深处，牧童自往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其六","author":"邹元标","text":"少日冒虚名，蹉跎百不成。\n无成真我学，倍觉去来轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶占七首 其七","author":"邹元标","text":"手种千桃树，扶疏向日红。\n须教时雨露，岁岁领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别杨如石孝廉四首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"我漱江边石，君棹渡头船。\n船去几千里，问君何日还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别杨如石孝廉四首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"问君何日还，衷情赖汝宣。\n极目天边雁，频将尺素传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别杨如石孝廉四首 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"秋江有芙蓉，采采赠夫君。\n采之不盈把，聊以慰停云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别杨如石孝廉四首 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"聊以慰停云，伫足听芳闻。\n怪杀江边水，流影照离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙华寺坐","author":"邹元标","text":"华堂闻鸟语，隔林送鸡声。\n悟證无生理，空门掉臂行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"多病宜逃世，浮名合敛踪。\n杜门安偃蹇，自性本愚慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"千句竟成閒，片言如泰山。\n欲知语与默，意在合离间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事三首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"慷慨当官易，蹉跎林下难。\n斋心期白首，敢负主恩宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事三首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"传家惟食力，笔札当躬耕。\n酌水漱残齿，优游度此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事三首 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"铅华曾久谢，老去能依人。\n脉脉绳床坐，情偏水石亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同贺汝定偕诸宋曾二文学登韩相岭二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"何年韩相岭，此日共攀跻。\n尔我投閒意，相看路不迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同贺汝定偕诸宋曾二文学登韩相岭二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"石如狮子吼，山作石头城。\n剩有莲花座，云深可结盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太常王塘南先生八十","author":"邹元标","text":"白首盟心日，祇园独坐时。\n鹏抟三万里，椿寿八千期。\n海宇仪公望，吾邦颂鲁尼。\n游神本淡漠，赋性自希夷。\n常灌门前李，深编户外篱。\n春风拂客座，时雨润枯枝。\n东海为仙醴，庐山作寿卮。\n独怜多病客，无路一探奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禾川别母","author":"邹元标","text":"问归情更切，驻马复迟迟。\n泪尽长川逝，心悬寸草知。\n乖离终是恨，重庆岂难期。\n会有金鸡诏，遐方酹酒时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"邹元标","text":"跏趺聊独坐，高枕忆王孙。\n雨滴阶前树，鸡鸣塞外村。\n真空怜我独，妙用向谁论。\n四大都零落，还馀一息存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观音寺杂兴","author":"邹元标","text":"病骨淹旬久，乏裁还尔思。\n残经谈去远，香积到来稀。\n默识同尼叟，忘言忆惠施。\n未须嫌寂莫，吾学贵心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"邹元标","text":"家徒四壁在，短鬓坐黄昏。\n微月临周幌，清风拂杜轩。\n閒来忘业障，静极见天根。\n俯仰乾坤里，谁人知我尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸生天坛歌咏盈野","author":"邹元标","text":"拨草天坛坐，翛然似习忘。\n雨馀千嶂静，春老百花香。\n玄论惊潭渚，狂歌闹夕阳。\n依稀童冠乐，不让舞雩乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写照口占","author":"邹元标","text":"暂寄镜中影，谁知物外身。\n本来无色相，何处著纤尘。\n事业从飘泊，生涯付隐沦。\n千秋谁只眼，彷佛见吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬罗公廓给谏","author":"邹元标","text":"老去交情重，怀君意转深。\n廿年青琐客，同赋白头吟。\n突兀千秋意，蹉跎万古心。\n嘤嘤闻好鸟，相唤出幽林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别朱鉴塘老师郊外口占二律 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"停车郊外寺，重会是何年。\n数仞宫墙峻，千秋情义偏。\n聆音今几席，判袂各风烟。\n出处真无计，回思亦怆然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别朱鉴塘老师郊外口占二律 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"三吴雄镇地，斧钺下青霄。\n简命先臣牧，纶音切帝尧。\n戈船云里集，楼阁镜中飘。\n筹策多公暇，坐看海气消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平山房 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"凿石临青嶂，开门俯碧流。\n生涯聊自适，世网复何求。\n睥睨千峰晓，藤萝万木秋。\n牛羊三径里，樵唱好赓酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平山房 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"出郭才半里，小构两三间。\n禾黍平高下，牛羊任往还。\n穿林寻窈窕，移步弄潺湲。\n架上书千卷，閒居取次删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平山房 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"邻曲两三家，晨昏共岁华。\n春来烹细笋，雨后试新茶。\n嵎虎成朝市，林蜂散午衙。\n居然寂寞意，静景得无哗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平山房 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"一榻挂楼居，八窗映碧虚。\n观空腾野马，纵目数游鱼。\n懒慢身堪寄，登临眼独舒。\n门前花鸟乱，疑枉故人车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"章衡阳省丈赴谪罗定州道文江宿小斋 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"十载知名久，初看是梦中。\n坐来人似玉，谭去气成虹。\n百粤风烟壮，千山道路穷。\n愿言频爱护，朝论倚山公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]